    <section class="screen" data-teach="greenhouse">
      <span class="tag lo">Greenhouse effect · 8.24</span>
      <h2>The greenhouse effect</h2>
      <p>Some gases — <span class="hl c">carbon dioxide</span>, <span class="hl t">methane</span> and <span class="hl k">water vapour</span> — are <b>greenhouse gases</b>. They <b>absorb heat (infrared) radiated from the Earth</b> and re-radiate energy, keeping the surface warm enough for life.</p>
      <figure>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 560 220" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Sunlight reaches the surface; the Earth radiates infrared, which greenhouse gases absorb and re-radiate">
